  "denv: ⟨⟨z - y⟩ + ⟨x + z⟩⟩^2 = ⟨z - y⟩^2 + 2 * ⟨z - y⟩ * ⟨x + z⟩ + ⟨x + z⟩^2",
  "denv proves? ⟨2 + 1⟩ * ⟨⟨0 * y⟩ - x⟩ + x * ⟨2 + 1⟩ = ⟨2 + 1⟩ * ⟨0 * y⟩",
  "denv: ⟨2 + 1⟩ * ⟨⟨0 * y⟩ - x⟩ + x * ⟨2 + 1⟩ = ⟨2 + 1⟩ * ⟨0 * y⟩",
